cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Knowledge3D: a GPU-native reference implementation for W3C PM-KR"
abstract: "Web knowledge is fragmented: duplicated across fonts, embeddings, metadata and renderings. Humans see pixels, AI sees tokens, and neither shares the source. Knowledge3D is a sovereign, GPU-native reference implementation for the W3C PM-KR Community Group, where humans and AI consume the same procedural knowledge from one source. Code under Apache-2.0; the white paper under CC BY 4.0."
authors:
